  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "qt: allow closing Add Packet Comment dialog with Ctrl/Cmd+Enter",
  "description": "Adds keyboard shortcut to close the \"Add Packet Comment\" dialog using:\n\n- ⌘+Return on macOS\n- Ctrl+Return on Windows/Linux\n\nThis allows users to quickly confirm the dialog without using the mouse. The change improves accessibility and is consistent with UI behavior in other Qt dialogs.\n\nTested on macOS. Should work on other platforms as well since `QKeySequence::InsertParagraphSeparator` already maps correctly per OS.\n\nFixes: #19958",
